Description:

Added the JMAP `urn:ietf:params:jmap:conditional` capability
(draft-ietf-jmap-conditional).  Every Foo/set accepts `ifUnchangedBy`,
a map of object id to a PatchObject the object must currently match.
If any precondition does not hold, the whole method is rejected with
`stateMismatch` and nothing changes.  `atomic: true` is rejected with
`cannotApplyAtomically`.


Documentation:

https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-jmap-conditional/


Config changes:

None


Upgrade instructions:

None.  The capability is advertised automatically, and clients that
don't name it in `using` see no change.


